'''Consecrated ground''' is a beneficial [[ground effect]]. The following effects are granted to those affected by it:
* [[Regenerate]] 5% of maximum [[life]] per second
* 50% reduced effect of [[curses]] on you

When created by enemies or the "of Consecration" [[map]] [[modifier]], consecrated ground will apply the 5% regeneration and reduced curse effect to enemies affected by it. Despite being considered a detrimental [[ground effect]], it has no effect on the player.<ref>See [[Version 3.15.0]] patch notes</ref>

[[File:Descry-consecrated-ground.jpg|thumb|Consecrated ground]]

==Related items==
The tables below displays [[items]] related to consecrated ground.

===Skill gems===
{{Drop enabled gem table
|where = skill.description LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%"
}}

===Base items===
{{Drop enabled base item table
|tables=items
|where= items.stat_text LIKE "%consecrate%ground%" AND items.class_id NOT LIKE "%Gem%"
|level=1
|large=1
|stat=1
}}

===Unique items===
{{Item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=  (item_stats.id LIKE "%consecrate%" OR items.stat_text LIKE "%consecrate%" )
AND items.rarity_id = "unique"
|level=1
|large=1
|stat=1
}}

==Related passive skills==
The table below displays [[passive skills]] related to consecrated ground.

{{Query base passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%consecrat%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AlternateAscendancy%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AscendancyCustom%"
}}

===Keystone passive skills===
{{Query keystone passive skills
|where=passive_skills.stat_text LIKE "%consecrat%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AlternateAscendancy%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AscendancyCustom%"
}}

===Ascendancy passive skills===
{{Query ascendancy passive skills
|where= passive_skills.stat_text LIKE "%consecrate%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AlternateAscendancy%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AscendancyCustom%"
}}

===Bloodline Ascendancy passive skills===
{{Query passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%consecrat%" AND passive_skills.id LIKE "%AlternateAscendancy%" AND passive_skills.id NOT LIKE "%AscendancyCustom%"
}}

===Tattoos/Runegrafts===
{{Drop enabled item table
|tables = tattoos
|join = items._pageID = tattoos._pageID
|where = items.class_id="StackableCurrency"
  AND tattoos.target IS NOT NULL
  AND items.description LIKE "%consecrat%"
|large=1
|description=1
}}

==Related modifiers==
===Item mods===
{{Query spawnable modifiers
|where=mods.domain IN ("1", "2", "10", "13") AND (mods.stat_text LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%" OR mod_stats.id LIKE "%consecrated%ground%" ) AND mods.generation_type NOT LIKE "10"
|spawn_weights=1
|generation_type=1
}}
====Elevated modifiers====
{{Modifier table
|q_tables=mod_stats, mod_spawn_weights
|q_join=mods._pageID=mod_stats._pageID, mods._pageID=mod_spawn_weights._pageID
|q_where= mods.name LIKE "%Elevated%" AND ( mods.stat_text LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%" OR mod_stats.id LIKE "%consecrated%ground%" )
|stat_text=1
|generation_type=1
|level=1
}}
====Synthesis implicit modifiers====
{{Modifier table
|q_tables=mod_stats, mod_spawn_weights
|q_join=mods._pageID=mod_stats._pageID, mods._pageID=mod_spawn_weights._pageID
|q_where= mods.id LIKE "%SynthesisImplicit%" AND domain = 1 AND ( mods.stat_text LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%" OR mod_stats.id LIKE "%consecrated%ground%" )
|stat_text=1
|level=1
|spawn_weights=1
}}

====Enchantments====
The table below displays [[enchantments]] related to consecrated ground.

{{Modifier table
|q_tables = mod_spawn_weights, skill
|q_join = mods._pageID=mod_spawn_weights._pageID, mods.granted_skill=skill.skill_id
|q_where = 
    (mods.stat_text LIKE "%consecrate%" OR skill.description LIKE "%consecrate%") 
    AND mods.generation_type = 10 AND mod_spawn_weights.value > 0
|q_orderBy = mods.id, mods.required_level
|stat_text=1
|enchantment=1
|spawn_weights=1
}}
====Map mods====
Consecrated ground-related modifiers for Map and map-like items
{{Query spawnable modifiers
|where=mods.domain IN ("5", "22") AND (mods.stat_text LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%" OR mod_stats.id LIKE "%consecrated%ground%" ) 
|spawn_weights=1
|domain=1
}}

===Other area mods===
{{Query spawnable modifiers
|where=mods.domain IN ("17", "18", "19", "29") AND (mods.stat_text LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%" OR mod_stats.id LIKE "%consecrated%ground%" ) 
|spawn_weights=1
|domain=1
}}
===Monster modifiers===
{{Modifier table
|q_tables=mod_stats, mod_spawn_weights
|q_join=mods._pageID=mod_stats._pageID, mods._pageID=mod_spawn_weights._pageID
|q_where= mods.domain = 3 AND ( mods.stat_text LIKE "%Consecrated Ground%" OR mod_stats.id LIKE "%consecrated%ground%" )
|stat_text=1
|generation_type=1
|level=1
|spawn_weights=1
}}

